WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:36.960
We forgot to lock the perp in again...

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:39.300
Ah, the chief's gonna have our badges for this one...

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:41.700
..I wont tell if you don't.

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:45.480
[huffing]

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:52.180
Credit TheReacher24 with help of the credits!!!

00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:55.080
[controlled breathing]

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:06.000
Bonnie: Okay, this is the place!

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:08.780
"What about Springtrap back at the office?"

00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:11.140
Chica: What if he escapes out into the streets?!

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:15.200
Nate: Look, you guys focus on getting inside... I'll handle Springtrap.

00:01:20.120 --> 00:01:21.760
[electronic beep]

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:23.800
(Robot voice): Hi

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:26.700
Okay buddy.  Let's keep him distracted.

00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:35.380
[something hits wall]
[Mark hollers, startled]

00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:38.540
[voice in distance]
[Mark breathes anxiously]

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:42.780
Foxy: Yaarrrgh

00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:44.240
[Mark screams]
[thud, Foxy grunts]

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:47.640
Chica: Foxy, are you okay?!
[Foxy stammers]

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:51.980
Nate: There you are.

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:56.580
Would you kindly follow me?

00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:02.080
[bb.exe beeping]
[Springtrap growling]

00:02:03.820 --> 00:02:06.520
Is it true? Are they back? Am I going mad?

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:11.340
One mistake's all it takes, and this may go bad!

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:17.040
No one's there!

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:21.640
No one-is somebody there?

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:26.580
Four more hours left for me to stall!

00:02:27.440 --> 00:02:31.520
Why's that furbag sneaking down the hall?

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:34.100
No one's there

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:36.340
Someone's there

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:40.080
Wish I could say someone's/no-one's there!

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:42.680
Chica: Hi there!

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:45.420
Okay good talk.

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:47.720
I'll Fill The Void With Noise...

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:54.500
Just Focus On Me!

00:02:55.520 --> 00:03:00.000
Somethings Breathing Out Beyond The Door!

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:04.640
Hey It's Me I Swear We Met Before...

00:03:04.940 --> 00:03:06.940
I dont care.

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:09.780
No one's there!

00:03:09.860 --> 00:03:11.400
Where'd Foxy go?

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:14.280
He's In There!

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:19.300
Hurry Guys I Think Im Losing Ground!

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:23.500
Why's my closet making pirate sounds?

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:25.040
Foxy: Yarrrrr!!!
[Mark screams]

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:26.300
Please Come Save Us!

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:29.040
Springtrap's Gone Insane!

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:34.260
Does This Help Explain?

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:36.260
Stay Back!

00:03:36.380 --> 00:03:37.760
Huh, I Guess It Didnt

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:38.700
Nate: OH!

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:39.820
(End Of Singing)

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:45.520
That's not good.

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:48.380
[BB.exe shuts down]

00:03:49.780 --> 00:03:51.980
Nate: NO NO NO NO COME ON! COME ON!

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:58.240
Freddy: Maybe we should just calm down and sing a special song togeth-

00:03:58.380 --> 00:03:59.820
Mark: SHUT UP BEAR.

00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:01.600
Bonnie: Okay just take it easy.

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:03.380
Chica: Can you please put down the knife?

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:08.780
Mark: Don't come any closer or I'l- I'll carve out his stuffing and wear his skin like a suit!!!

00:04:08.780 --> 00:04:10.480
Bonnie: Well, now he's just being ridiculous.

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:14.700
Nate: pleeeaaaaase get up.

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:26.020
Mark: Y-You're not taking me alive!!!

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:27.660
Bonnie: Uh, we're not taking you at all.

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:29.280
Chica: We aren't here to hurt you!

00:04:29.780 --> 00:04:32.180
Mark: Get away from me I-I'll do it, I swear!!!

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:34.520
Freddy: Please don't kill me!

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:36.360
Nate: I'd be careful with that knife.

00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:42.400
That's Freddy Fazbear.  He holds a special place in the hearts of children, soooooo...

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:44.640
you should show him a little respect.

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:47.820
Mark: You have the Night Shift...?

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:49.600
Are you with THEM?!?!

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:52.240
Nate: [sarcastically]  No I'm the Uber Driver for a bunch of puppets.

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:53.380
Mark: What do you want?

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:56.740
Chica: YOUR HELP

00:04:56.740 --> 00:05:00.160
Freddy: THERE'S A KILLER ANMATRONICS ON THE LOSE AT FREDDY FAZBEAR'S!!!

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:03.840
Nate: We'd go to the police, but... they'd probably think we're crazy.

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:05.200
Bonnie: Sound familiar?

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:07.260
Mark: O-okay wait, hang on a second.

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:13.120
Even if I was to believe that you TALKING robots didn't want to kill me,

00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:19.640
and even if I was willing to go back to FREDDY FAZBEAR'S -- which I'm NOT--

00:05:20.120 --> 00:05:22.120
What do I get out of this?

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:23.640
Psychological damage?

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:25.120
Uh, a horrible gruesome death?

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:29.600
25 years to life with a cellmate named BUFFALO-FRICKIN-BILL!!!!!

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:31.000
[Foxy emits ponderous grunt]

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:35.000
Nate: Uh I don't know. Proving you didn't lie to the police would be pretty cool.

00:05:37.220 --> 00:05:38.140
Mark: Fine.

00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:39.520
Freddy: HURRAY!!!

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:42.880
Mark: Don't touch me.

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:48.040
Nate: Freddy's opens in a few hours. We should lay low until everyone leaves for the night.

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:50.020
Bonnie: Who wants to listen to some awesome tunes?

00:05:50.420 --> 00:05:55.620
Radio: BABY I LOVE YOU ( BABY I) OOOOOO

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:57.440
YOU'RE SO FIIIIIINE

00:05:57.560 --> 00:06:00.040
Mark: SHUT THAT OFF OR I WILL KILL YOU.

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:04.640
*SCREACH*

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:10.020
Freddy: There's a killer animatronic, and he's filled with poop, and I don't like him,

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:10.920
and he's gross.

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:13.620
[ drowning sounds]

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:15.300
Mark: Hey guys, thanks so much for watching.

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:17.800
If you enjoyed this video, there's actually another night

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:19.860
and many previous nights to watch.

00:06:19.860 --> 00:06:21.180
All the links are in the description below

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:23.340
and annotations all around my face.

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:25.920
THANK YOU, Random Encounters.  THANK YOU, Natewantstobattle

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:29.280
THANK YOU, everyone who is behind the scenes as well

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:34.780
And thank you for watching. I'll be here [breaths in air] RELAXING.

